    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Integers include positive numbers, zero and negative numbers. On a number line, positive numbers lie to the right of zero and negative numbers to the left.\nTo add a positive number move right; to add a negative number move left. 5 plus -3 is 2, and -3 plus 5 is 2.\nTo subtract a number, add its opposite. 4 minus 7 is 4 plus -7, which is -3."
    }
